{"name":"Thredbo","hex":"#73c4d7","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Thredbo","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A locality in the Snowy Monaro council area, south eastern New South Wales, Australia."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Thredbo"}],"entries":[{"title":"Thredbo","blocks":[{"text":"Thredbo is a village and ski resort in the Snowy Mountains of New South Wales, Australia. It is approximately 500 kilometres (310 mi) south of Sydney, accessible by the Alpine Way via Cooma, Berridale and Jindabyne. The village is built in the valley of the Thredbo River, also known as the Crackenback River, at the foot of the Ramshead Range."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/e3/Thredbo_logo.png/330px-Thredbo_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thredbo"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Thredbo_July_2011.jpg/500px-Thredbo_July_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Thredbo_July_2011.jpg/500px-Thredbo_July_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThredbo_July_2011.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Thredbo_resort.jpg/500px-Thredbo_resort.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Thredbo_resort.jpg/1280px-Thredbo_resort.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Thredbo_resort.jpg/500px-Thredbo_resort.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Merrits","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThredbo_resort.jp